\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr firms slightly, forwards off morning highs.   \b0\par\par\uc2 592 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 2003\par 11:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     HONG KONG, Dec 29 (Reuters) - The Hong Kong dollar inched\par higher against the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Monday afternoon but\par dealers said trading was confined to a narrow range in modest\par volume.\par     "There were some big names selling U.S. dollars... There\par was probably corporate demand for the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for\par the year-end," said a dealer from a Japanese bank.\par  \par     The local unit        traded at 7.7636/38 at 0945 GMT,\par compared with 7.7654/55 late on Wednesday.\par     Hong Kong's money market was closed on Thursday and Friday\par for Christmas holidays.\par     The Hong Kong dollar has strengthened above its pegged\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 minimum of 7.80 per dollar since late September, driven by   \f28 \par \par \uc2 speculation about a revaluation of the Chinese yuan, brighter   \par \par \uc2 domestic economic prospects and increased fund flows.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the weakness of the U.S. dollar, on mounting   \par \par \uc2 geopolitical worries and the yawning U.S. current account   \par \par \uc2 deficit, has also lent support to the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 "The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to remain strong as there are   \par \par \uc2 many Chinese firms to list in the Hong Kong stock market next   \par \par \uc2 year. That will attract more funds into the territory," another   \par \par \uc2 trader from a European bank said.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Most dealers expect the Hong Kong dollar to move within a\par range of 7.76 to 7.77 per dollar in the near term.\par     The discount on Hong Kong dollar forwards widened in the\par afternoon, following a firmer spot exchange rate.\par     Longer-dated forwards' discount traded tighter in the\par morning on a suspected SARS case in China.\par     "The market saw little impact from the SARS case. People\par are confident that SARS is still under control," one trader\par said.\par     "The forwards are likely to keep a deeper discount if the\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 exchange rate remains strong with the risk of further   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the HKMA," the dealer added, referring to the   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the city's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China reported on the weekend that a man had been admitted   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 to hospital in the southern province of Guangdong with SARS   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 symptoms. He is now in a stable condition under quarantine.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The discount on one-year forwards was trading   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 around 560/545 pips late on Monday, versus 540 pips in the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 morning and little changed from Wednesday's close of 560/540   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 pips.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hong Kong interbank rates remained at low levels.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 One dealer at a local bank said most activity was centred   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on the overnight interbank rate, with players squaring   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 positions.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The overnight rate was quoted at 0.005 percent by late   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 afternoon. Local interbank rates have been trading below the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. dollar rates in recent months after a string of injections   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 from the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in a bid to stabilise the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                      Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                      At 0945 GMT   At 0330 GMT   At 0746 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT         7.7636/38     7.7653/54     7.7653/54\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -186 / -180   -182 / -175   -189 / -184\par     Six-month        -350 / -340   -350 / -340   -355 / -340\par     One-year         -560 / -545   -550 / -530   -560 / -540\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight       0.005 / 0.005 0.005 / 0.008 0.001 / 0.005\par     Three-month      0.12 / 0.13   0.10 / 0.15   0.10 / 0.15\par     Six-month        0.21 / 0.23   0.20 / 0.25   0.22 / 0.28\par     One-year         0.63 / 0.68   0.60 / 0.68   0.65 / 0.73\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Live quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on Reuters contributor page .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031229dzct0029w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
