\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr little change, HKMA chief sees more inflows.   \b0\par\par\uc2 698 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 2003\par 11:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     HONG KONG, Dec 16 (Reuters) - The Hong Kong dollar moved in\par a narrow range and remained above its pegged rate with the U.S.\par unit on Tuesday despite another round of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (HKMA).\par     Hopes that share prices will continue their strong gains\par over coming weeks are keeping demand for the local unit strong,\par analysts said.\par     The HKMA, the territory's de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , sold\par HK$4.037 billion on Tuesday afternoon in four separate moves,\par following numerous \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in previous sessions in a bid\par to stabilise the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's strength.\par     Since Friday, the HKMA has sold a total of HK$11.56\par billion. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will lift the aggregate balance -- a\par key measure of interbank liquidity -- to HK$23.90 billion by\par Thursday.\par     The Hong Kong dollar        was traded at 7.7629/30 against\par the U.S. unit at 0933 GMT, little changed from 7.7630 late on\par Monday.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Television quoted HKMA Chief Executive Joseph Yam as saying\par that a recent string of initial public offerings (IPOs) has\par triggered a surge in demand for Hong Kong dollars.\par     "Under the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  board system, we carry out mechanically\par what you term as \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , but we are really going by the\par book," Yam said.\par  \par     "In the short term, I can see that there will be more funds\par flowing in, so the banks' aggregate balance would get larger."\par     The HKMA has said it will not formally set a limit on how\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par strong it would allow the Hong Kong dollar to get, but it is\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par committed to preventing the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from weakening below the\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par HK$7.80 per U.S. unit mark.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Recent IPOs have drawn frenzied demand. China Life\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Insurance  is the world's biggest IPO this year after\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the company raised US$3 billion from its offering, which starts\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trade in New York on Wednesday and a day later in Hong Kong.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has strengthened since late September,\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par driven by speculation about the revaluation of the renminbi,\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par brighter domestic economic prospects and increased fund flows.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bearish sentiment towards the U.S. dollar on persistent\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par concerns over a ballooning U.S. current account deficit have\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par also lent support to the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Hong Kong interbank rates were mixed. Short-dated rates\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par remained firm due to tighter liquidity as funds remained locked\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The overnight and one-week rates were quoted at 0.43-0.5\par percent and 0.68-0.75 percent respectively.\par     Longer-dated rates eased in anticipation of liquidity\par improving after the IPOs with a large aggregate balance.\par     "Rates are expected to ease later this week when the\par receiving banks clear the cheques," said a dealer from a local\par bank.\par     The one-month interbank rate eased to 0.73-0.78 by late\par afternoon from 0.82-0.87 percent on Monday.\par     Hong Kong dollar forwards tracked the movement in interbank\par rates. Longer-dated contracts continued to be weighted down by\par an expansion in the aggregate balance.\par     The tomorrow/next (T/N) forwards          were trading at\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around par to a premium of one pip, while the discount on\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par one-year contracts  widened to a new low of 540/520\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par pips.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Players were selling longer-dated forwards on expectations\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of loose liquidity after the IPOs. The next target for the\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par one-year contract is -600 pips," one trader at a Japanese bank\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                     Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                     At 0904 GMT   At 0330 GMT   At 0900 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT        7.7629/30     7.7629/30     7.7629/30\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month     -180 / -173   -175 / -170   -175 / -170\par     Six-month       -345 / -335   -330 / -315   -315 / -305\par     One-year        -540 / -520   -480 / -460   -450 / -430\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight       0.43 / 0.50   0.25 / 0.40   0.75 / 0.87\par     Three-month     0.19 / 0.22   0.17 / 0.22   0.18 / 0.23\par     Six-month       0.31 / 0.33   0.31 / 0.37   0.33 / 0.38\par     One-year        0.73 / 0.78   0.75 / 0.81   0.82 / 0.87\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Live quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on Reuters contributor page .\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031216dzcg002a4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
