\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr remains strong despite HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 596 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 2003\par 11:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Dec 12 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar stayed\par stubbornly above its pegged exchange rate to the U.S. unit on\par Friday despite \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par (HKMA) to weaken it.\par  \par     Demand for the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  remained strong with several\par large share issues looming, traders said.\par     The HKMA, the territory's de-facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , said it\par had bought US$120 million and sold HK$932 million in two\par transactions.\par     At 0950 GMT, the Hong Kong dollar        was trading at\par 7.7629 against the U.S. unit, versus the opening at the 7.7650\par level, and firmer than 7.7645 at 0928 GMT on Thursday.\par     "The inflow of funds may be related to the recent IPOs\par subscription," said a dealer from a European bank.\par     A trader at a Japanese bank said he thought the HKMA's\par action was aimed at easing the upward pressure on short-term\par rates.\par     Front-end interest rates have jumped this week as a flood\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 of cash for big share offerings - including the world's   \f28 \par \par \uc2 largest this year from China Life Insurance Co Ltd -   \par \par \uc2 has been parked in banks.   \par \par \uc2 The overnight rate climbed to as high as one percent in   \par \par \uc2 recent sessions, compared with 0.001 to 0.005 percent last   \par \par \uc2 week.   \par \par \uc2 "Liquidity will only be eased after December 17 when the   \par \par \uc2 IPOs are over and the receiving banks clear the cheques," a   \par \par \uc2 trader at a local bank said.   \par \par \uc2 The retail portion of mainland car maker Great Wall   \par \par \uc2 Automobile's IPO was 683 times subscribed and has   \par \par \uc2 frozen about HK$104 billion, while the retail portion of China   \par \par \uc2 Life's IPO was more than 170 times subscribed and has tied up   \par \par \uc2 about HK$200 billion, market sources say.   \par \par \uc2 Gold miner Fujian Zijin Mining Industry Co Ltd   \par \par \uc2 kicked off a share sale to retail investors on Thursday, with a   \par \par \uc2 deadline of December 16. It is raising up to HK$1.15 billion.   \par \par \uc2 Hong Kong interbank rates opened mixed on Friday, with   \par \par \uc2 short-term rates lingering at high levels due to IPO-induced   \par \par \uc2 funds demand but longer-dated rates easing following lower U.S.   \par \par \uc2 bond yields.   \par \par \uc2 The overnight rate opened at around one percent but   \par \par \uc2 softened to 0.50 percent after a major player released cash in   \par \par \uc2 mid-morning, dealers said. By late afternoon, the overnight   \par \par \uc2 rate remained at 0.5 percent, while the tomorrow/next rate   \par \par \uc2 traded at 0.65 to 0.70 percent.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     After the HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , other interbank rates eased\par further and the discount on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar forwards deepened.\par     The one-year interbank rate fell to 0.70 to 0.81 percent\par from 0.83 to 0.88 percent in the morning.\par     The discount on one-year forwards          widened to\par 450/430 pips from Thursday's 430/410 pips.\par                     Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                     At 0854 GMT   At 0317 GMT   At 0840 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT        7.7630/35     7.7643/48     7.7640/44\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month     -182 / -172   -172 / -162   -170 / -165\par     Six-month      -320 / -310   -305 / -295   -310 / -300\par     One-year        -450 / -430   -420 / -400   -430 / -410\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight       0.50 / 0.50   0.40 / 0.60   1.00 / 1.12\par     Three-month     0.15 / 0.20   0.20 / 0.25   0.23 / 0.28\par     Six-month       0.30 / 0.35   0.35 / 0.40   0.36 / 0.41\par     One-year        0.70 / 0.81   0.83 / 0.88   0.87 / 0.92\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Live quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on Reuters contributor page .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031212dzcc001yu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
