\par\par \b \uc2 Hong Kong dollar eases in thin range-bound trade.  \b0\par\par\uc2 465 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 2003\par 11:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     HONG KONG, Dec 4 (Reuters) - The Hong Kong dollar weakened\par in the face of bidding interest in the U.S. dollar on Thursday,\par but dealers said trade was range-bound and light.\par     "There was some buying in the spot and forwards markets but\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 a lack of follow-through action. With the market volume being  \f28 \par \par \uc2 so thin, even a moderate amount of buying resulted in notable  \par \par \uc2 movement," said a dealer from a Japanese bank.  \par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong dollar traded between 7.7630 and  \par \par \uc2 7.7660 for most of the day. It was at 7.7654 at 0848 GMT,  \par \par \uc2 compared with 7.7631 at 0927 GMT on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 Hong Kong dollar forward discounts narrowed  \par \par \uc2 correspondingly, with the one-year contracts  \par \par \uc2 tightening to 420/400 pips from 460/440 pips late on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 One trader from a European bank said there would be some  \par \par \uc2 seasonal corporate buying of U.S. dollars ahead of the  \par \par \uc2 year-end.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA) has repeatedly  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent months to buy U.S. dollars and sell the  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar.  \par \par \uc2 A trader said the HKMA had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around 7.76 lately  \par \par \uc2 and market players saw that as a support level for the U.S.  \par \par \uc2 dollar.  \par \par \uc2 "Therefore, there is some buying interest in U.S. unit  \par \par \uc2 against the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  whenever the USD spot rate falls to  \par \par \uc2 close to 7.76, but selling will emerge whenever the spot rate  \par \par \uc2 edges up to around 7.77," the trader said.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the U.S. dollar faces a key barrier at 7.77.  \par \par \uc2 The spot rate has made several attempts to break above that  \par \par \uc2 level since late September, but has repeatedly failed.  \par \par \uc2 Some dealers said the Hong Kong dollar could climb again as  \par \par \uc2 funds continue to flow in for upcoming initial public offerings  \par \par \uc2 in the territory and as investors remain bearish on the U.S.  \par \par \uc2 dollar.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     However, they said the upside would be limited amid fears\par of further \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from the HKMA.\par                     Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                     At 0830 GMT   At 0315 GMT   At 0900 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT        7.7655/59     7.7653/58     7.7624/34\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month     -180 / -175   -180 / -175   -182 / -180\par     Six-month       -305 / -295   -300 / -290   -315 / -305\par     One-year        -420 / -400   -420 / -400   -460 / -440\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight      0.003 / 0.005 0.005 / 0.006 0.005 / 0.006\par     Three-month     0.17 / 0.22   0.17 / 0.22   0.17 / 0.19\par     Six-month       0.39 / 0.46   0.39 / 0.46   0.38 / 0.41\par     One-year        1.04 / 1.09   0.95 / 1.06   0.95 / 1.00\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Live quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on Reuters contributor page .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031204dzc40020i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
