\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr weakens to two-week low on arbitrage.   \b0\par\par\uc2 611 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 November 2003\par 11:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     HONG KONG, Nov 25 (Reuters) - The Hong Kong dollar weakened\par against the U.S. unit on Tuesday, touching a two-week low, due\par to arbitrage activities and expectations of limited upside for\par the pegged \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     "The local unit has been gradually weakening against the\par dollar after frequent \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the HKMA last week,\par which has given a strong message to the market that it was\par committed to exchange rate stability," said a dealer from a\par European bank.\par     He added the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (HKMA), the de\par facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at around 7.75-7.76 and\par those were seen as support levels.\par     Traders also attributed the softening of the Hong Kong\par dollar to a recent announcement that locally-licensed banks\par would be able to run personal yuan business in the city from\par early 2004.\par     This would attract yuan flow into Hong Kong, easing the\par upward pressure on the yuan and therefore the Hong Kong dollar,\par dealers added.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Hong Kong dollar has been trading above its linked\par exchange rate since late September after Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par strengthened following a call by the Group of Seven industrial\par nations for more flexible exchange rates.\par     The local unit weakened to a two-week low of 7.7690 to the\par dollar at 0951 GMT, versus 7.7647 at 0915 GMT on Monday, but\par was still stronger than the 7.80 linked exchange rate.\par  \par     Some dealers see strong support at 7.77, where players are\par expected to take profits on U.S. dollars.\par     "There has been persistent bidding interest for the U.S.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollar and I believe there are some arbitrage trades given   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 local interbank rates remain lower than their U.S.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 counterparts," another trader said.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The HKMA has injected a total of HK$11.019 billion into the   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 aggregate balance - a key measure of interbank liquidity -   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 over the past months to stabilise the strengthening \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 pushing short-term interbank rates near to zero.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The discount on Hong Kong dollar forwards narrowed, driven\par by the firming spot rate.\par     "Now that the US/HK dollar spot rate has risen to the\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 current level, the HKMA is less likely to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  further.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Therefore, some people are willing to buy back forwards. There   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 was also some short covering of positions," said a dealer at a   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 French bank.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The discount on one-year forwards          narrowed to\par 330/310 from 415/400 pips late on Monday.\par     In the cash market, longer-dated interbank rates inched up,\par tracking Monday's rises in U.S. bond yields as well as a\par tightening in discounts on Hong Kong dollar forwards.\par     The one-year local interbank rate was quoted at 0.95-0.98\par percent, up from 0.82-0.85 percent.\par     Dealers said they would keep an eye on U.S. third-quarter\par gross domestic product data at 1330 GMT for trading clues.\par                     Close         Morning       Previous Close\par                     At 0854 GMT   At 0325 GMT   At 0915 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT        7.7682/85     7.7667/73     7.7642/47\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month     -175 / -170   -183 / -178   -192 / -182\par     Six-month       -170 / -260   -290 / -280   -310 / -300\par     One-year        -325 / -315   -370 / -350   -415 / -400\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight      0.001 / 0.001 0.002 / 0.003 0.001 / 0.003\par     Three-month     0.19 / 0.21   0.14 / 0.15   0.12 / 0.12\par     Six-month       0.40 / 0.43   0.35 / 0.38   0.32 / 0.34\par     One-year        0.95 / 0.98   0.90 / 0.92   0.82 / 0.85\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Live quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 on Reuters contributor page .   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031125dzbp0021n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
