\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr remains strong despite HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 498 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 2003\par 04:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Nov 19 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar remained\par stubbornly above its pegged exchange rate to the U.S. dollar on\par Wednesday morning despite overnight \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong\par Kong Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to try to weaken it in overseas markets.\par     The HKMA, the territory's de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par in the market three times on Tuesday during London and New York\par trading hours and bought a total of US$170 million against the HK\par dollar in an effort to stabilise the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par  \par     However, the local unit remained at the 7.75 level, above its\par 7.80 peg to the U.S. dollar.\par     Dealers said banks in Hong Kong were becoming cautious about\par the size of their short term U.S. dollar holdings due to recent\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  volatility.\par     "I think many banks in Hong Kong have recently given\par instructions to traders to limit the size of U.S. dollar holdings\par to control \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  risk," said a dealer from a European bank.\par     The HK dollar has been bolstered by fund inflows from\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2  investors looking to participate in upcoming IPOs, by an    \par \par \uc2  improving economic picture and by those punting on a medium term    \par \par \uc2  revaluation of China's yuan, say traders.    \par \par \uc2  However, despite U.S. pressure China has repeatedly played    \par \par \uc2  down the prospect of a revaluation, saying economic stability is    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Some dealers also said investors were reluctant to buy U.S.\par dollars against the local unit in arbitrage.\par     "As the interest rate differential between U.S. dollar and\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Hong Kong dollar is only one percentage point, there is in fact\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par not much of an incentive for people to buy U.S. dollar," another\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     At 0236 GMT, the Hong Kong dollar        was trading at\par 7.7566, compared with 7.7572 at 1702 GMT on Tuesday.\par     Traders see a risk of further HKMA \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the near\par term, which will push local interbank rates down further and\par deepen the discount on Hong Kong dollar forwards.\par     The discount on one-year Hong Kong dollar forwards\par broke the key support of 400 pips and widened to 460/440 pips on\par Thursday morning from 385 pips late on Tuesday.\par     In the cash market, interbank rates fell across the board.\par The one-year rate was quoted at 0.75-0.77 percent, down from\par 0.85-0.88 percent on Tuesday, said a dealer at a local bank.\par                     Morning       Previous Close\par                     At 0200 GMT   At 0843 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT        7.7562/68     7.7610/12\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month     -200 / -193   -185 / -180\par     Six-month       -345 / -335   -300 / -290\par     One-year        -460 / -440   -390 / -370\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight      0.001 / 0.001 0.001 / 0.005\par     Three-month     0.09 / 0.11   0.14 / 0.18\par     Six-month       0.23 / 0.25   0.37 / 0.42\par     One-year        0.75 / 0.77   0.87 / 0.93\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Reuters contributor page .\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031119dzbj000mv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
