\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr ends up despite  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , seen strong.  \b0\par\par\uc2 799 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 November 2003\par 10:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Nov 14 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar ended the\par week above its pegged exchange rate to the U.S. dollar despite a\par further \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  late on Friday by the territory's de facto\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to try to weaken it.\par  \par     Analysts and dealers said they expect the local unit's\par strength to persist over the next week at least.\par     "Eventually the Hong Kong dollar will move back towards the\par HK$7.77 level, but not for now," said a dealer at a European bank\par in Hong Kong.\par     Continuing demand for Hong Kong dollars for upcoming share\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 issues and ongoing speculation that China may eventually revalue  \f28 \par \par \uc2 its yuan \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  have kept the Hong Kong unit firm in recent  \par \par \uc2 months.  \par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong dollar was trading at 7.7578/98 per U.S.  \par \par \uc2 dollar at 0917 GMT compared to its late morning level of  \par \par \uc2 7.7628/38, and firmer than HK$7.7655/60 at the close of Hong Kong  \par \par \uc2 trade on Thursday. It had strengthened to 7.7380/90 in London on  \par \par \uc2 Monday.  \par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong dollar had firmed to about HK$7.70 late in  \par \par \uc2 September compared with its pegged exchange rate of HK$7.80  \par \par \uc2 following calls by industrialised nations for more flexible  \par \par \uc2 exchange rates in Asia.  \par \par \uc2 The HKMA \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  late on Friday for the seventh time this  \par \par \uc2 week, buying about US$100 million in addition to the US$500  \par \par \uc2 million it bought earlier in the week. The move caused a brief  \par \par \uc2 weakening in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  before it firmed up again.  \par \par \uc2 The discount on the one-year Hong Kong dollar forwards  \par \par \uc2 contract stood at 360/350 pips from the morning's -330/-310 pips  \par \par \uc2 level, and from -320/-300 late on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 The widening discount implies that the market expects the  \par \par \uc2 local unit to remain firm in coming sessions. Analysts said there  \par \par \uc2 was no limit to how much Hong Kong dollars the HKMA could sell.  \par \par \uc2 "As long as the HKMA's sales and issuance of Hong Kong  \par \par \uc2 dollars are backed by U.S. dollars, and if they sell Hong Kong  \par \par \uc2 dollars and credit the clearing accounts of banks, it's OK. All  \par \par \uc2 this Hong Kong dollar printing is 100 percent backed by U.S.  \par \par \uc2 dollars," said Eddie Wong, chief strategist for Asia at ABN AMRO  \par \par \uc2 in Hong Kong.  \par \par \uc2 "The concern is that surplus liquidity will continue to flood  \par \par \uc2 into the clearing accounts of the banks and Hong Kong interbank  \par \par \uc2 rates could become zero," he added.  \par \par \uc2 "What the HKMA might do is to issue Exchange Fund bills to  \par \par \uc2 mop up the surplus funds in the banks if necessary, and that  \par \par \uc2 would make the issuing of Hong Kong dollars even more  \par \par \uc2 open-ended," Wong said.  \par \par \uc2 The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it would be  \par \par \uc2 happy to keep Hong Kong dollar interbank rates lower than those  \par \par \uc2 for the U.S. dollar as this would help to encourage consumption.  \par \par \uc2 "The HKMA is preparing the public for significant injections  \par \par \uc2 of liquidity," said James Malcolm, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at JP  \par \par \uc2 Morgan Chase in Singapore.  \par \par \uc2 "The whole point of having a lot of liquidity sloshing around  \par \par \uc2 the system is to make the opportunity cost of not buying U.S.  \par \par \uc2 dollars increasingly high," Malcolm said.  \par \par \uc2 Overnight Hong Kong dollar interbank rates have fallen to  \par \par \uc2 nearly zero since late September when the Hong Kong dollar staged  \par \par \uc2 its highly unusual appreciation against the U.S. dollar, driven  \par \par \uc2 by speculation that the Chinese yuan could be revalued following  \par \par \uc2 intense pressure from industrialised nations.  \par \par \uc2 This has left Hong Kong dollar interest rates about one full  \par \par \uc2 percentage point below those for the U.S. dollar. Under the  \par \par \uc2 territory's 20-year-old \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board regime, the HKMA is tasked  \par \par \uc2 with maintaining the stability of the Hong Kong dollar.  \par \par \uc2 While it is obliged to defend the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from  \par \par \uc2 weakening below the HK$7.80 per dollar level, it is not mandated  \par \par \uc2 to prevent it from strengthening above that level, as long as the  \par \par \uc2 exchange rate is kept relatively stable.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                     Close           Morning       Previous Close\par                     At 0915 GMT     At 0425 GMT   At 0917 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT        7.7570/81       7.7629/39     7.7630/35\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month     -184 / -179     -185 / -178   -180 / -170\par     Six-month       -296 / -286     -288 / -278   -270 / -260\par     One-year        -360 / -350     -320 / -305   -320 / -300\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight       0.01 / 0.06     0.00 / 0.00   0.02 / 0.03\par     Three-month     0.12 / 0.24     0.03 / 0.21   0.20 / 0.25\par     Six-month       0.34 / 0.46     0.25 / 0.50   0.43 / 0.48\par     One-year        0.75 / 1.00     0.81 / 1.06   1.05 / 1.10\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reuters contributor page .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031114dzbe0020m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
