\par\par \b \uc2 HK dlr remains strong despite HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 405 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 2003\par 05:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HONG KONG\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Oct 15 (Reuters) - The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Hong Kong\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar was\par slightly firmer against the greenback on Wednesday morning\par despite the Hong Kong \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's (HKMA) move on Tuesday\par to buy U.S. dollars against the local unit.\par  \par     "I think the market will continue to trade in a wider range\par as there is no upper limit on HKD strength," one dealer said.\par     At 0238 GMT, the local unit was trading at 7.7415 per U.S.\par dollar, compared with Tuesday's 7.75 and still well above its\par HK$7.80 pegged exchange rate.\par     The Hong Kong dollar has been trading above its linked\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 exchange rate since late last month after Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 strengthened following a call by G7 industrial nations for more   \par \par \uc2 flexible exchange rates.   \par \par \uc2 The HKMA has now \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  six times within a four-week   \par \par \uc2 period, injecting a total of HK$3.751 billion into the aggregate   \par \par \uc2 balance. The territory's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is forecasting the   \par \par \uc2 aggregate balance - a key measure of interbank liquidity - to   \par \par \uc2 rise to HK$4.166 billion at settlement on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 The HKMA is obligated to defend the Hong Kong dollar from   \par \par \uc2 weakening below HK$7.80, but has no mandate to stop it from   \par \par \uc2 strengthening above that level.   \par \par \uc2 The discount on Hong Kong dollar forwards widened, tracking   \par \par \uc2 the movement in the spot rate and supported by an expansion in   \par \par \uc2 the aggregate balance.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     One-year forwards          were trading at around -200/-180\par pips, versus -155/-125 pips late on Tuesday.\par     The market is also looking ahead to U.S. President George W.\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bush's trip to Asia, beginning this week. He is expected to press   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China and Japan to stop trying to weaken their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , a   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 factor that American manufacturers say is hurting their exports.    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                      Morning       Previous Close\par                      At 0315 GMT   At 0925 GMT\par     HK$ SPOT         7.7407/17     7.7483/93\par     FORWARDS\par     Three-month      -155 / -145   -125 / -115\par     Six-month        -200 / -180   -155 / -140\par     One-year         -200 / -180   -155 / -125\par     INTERBANK RATE (PERCENTAGE)\par     Overnight        0.03 / 0.06   0.03 / 0.03\par     Three-month      0.31 / 0.43   0.46 / 0.50\par     Six-month        0.62 / 0.68   0.65 / 0.68\par     One-year         1.00 / 1.08   1.03 / 1.06\par     Source: Indicative quotes were taken from Reuters pages. Live\par quotes for both Forwards and Interbank Rates can be viewed on\par Reuters contributor page .\par     (US$=HK$7.8).\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031015dzaf000w8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
